{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19686","headline":"登少陵原望秦中诸川太原王至德妙用有水术因用感叹 · 吕温","name":"登少陵原望秦中诸川太原王至德妙用有水术因用感叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少陵最高处，旷望极秋空。\n君山喷清源，脉散秦川中。\n荷锸自成雨，由来非鬼工。\n如何盛明代，委弃伤豳风。\n泾灞徒络绎，漆沮虚会同。\n东流滔滔去，沃野飞秋蓬。\n大禹平水土，吾人得其宗。\n发机回地势，运思与天通。\n早欲献奇策，丰财叙西戎。\n岂知年三十，未识大明宫。\n卷尔出岫云，追吾入冥鸿。\n无爲学惊俗，狂醉哭途穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}